## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Profession Profit
## Notes: Shows which of your Cooking, Engineering and Tailoring recipes make a profit (vendor or auction house prices from Auctionator), ranks Enchanting disenchants, counts your crafting luck and what your auctions really bring in, and adds + buttons to buy materials at a vendor or Create All on the best craft (/fpp).
